WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:07.440
I have waited for this to happen for this to&nbsp;
happen since July 3rd 2020, 2 years and 67&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.400
chapters ago, where Eiichiro Oda&nbsp;
first introduced us to Yamato,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:19.040
son of Kaido, self-declared Kozuki Oden and&nbsp;
one of the most fun and awesome characters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.760
in all of One Piece. And now&nbsp;
with the release of chapter 1051,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:31.440
I'm gonna take a risk and declare, that it is now&nbsp;
official that Yamato is gonna be the 11th straw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:37.360
hat that will join Luffy's quest to become&nbsp;
king of the pirates and find the One Piece.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:42.400
I have been praying for this to happen&nbsp;
for so long, and just couldn't help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:48.560
jumping around the room grinning when Yamato&nbsp;
introduced herself to the straw hat crew.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:53.280
Also, just to get it out of the way, I will&nbsp;
refer to Yamato as a she in this video,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:58.080
because I personally think Yamato&nbsp;
isn't identifying herself as a man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:04.800
like Kiku or Izu do as a woman. Much rather&nbsp;
she wants to be Oden, for what he represented&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:10.880
and stood for. A man that gave her hope, strength&nbsp;
and courage in her lonely and painful childhood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:15.920
that she embraced as a sort of mental&nbsp;
shield to not break under Kaido's tyranny.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:21.680
Being Oden for Yamato seems to be a value and&nbsp;
personality-based thing to me. It's something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:27.040
that she will actually have to learn to drop as&nbsp;
she will go and travel with the straw hats to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:34.160
accept herself and her own strength. Trying to be&nbsp;
someone else I think is actually a character flaw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:41.600
that Oda-sensei gave her, that she will need to&nbsp;
overcome. Because Yamato has, as we know already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:48.640
an incredibly strong will and personality, that is&nbsp;
quite unique and distinct from Oden. If anything,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:54.960
her true self seems to be much closer to&nbsp;
Luffy I think. And apart from Oden's ideology,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:01.520
I personally think she very clearly embraces her&nbsp;
femininity and so I will refer to her as 'she',&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.920
at least until we get any evidence to&nbsp;
the opposite. I hope that makes sense.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:13.440
But with that out of the way. Here's why I think&nbsp;
that Yamato is and always has been the perfect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:18.640
candidate to join the crew and how&nbsp;
she will make the straw hats journey&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:22.480
even more enjoyable to follow than it already is.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:29.040
I think it's really really easy to see, that&nbsp;
Oda-sensei had a lot of fun developing and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:33.360
writing Yamato into the story. I'd like&nbsp;
to think, that the idea for this character&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:40.480
has been ready somewhere in his drawer for a&nbsp;
long long time, where he was itching to finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:46.960
reveal her. Even though character-writing&nbsp;
is Oda-sensei's absolute supreme discipline,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:53.120
Yamato stood out as something special to&nbsp;
me right from the start. With every single&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:58.400
chapter and every single panel that she was&nbsp;
in, we learned so much about her personality,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:05.280
her fears and hopes and what she stands and fights&nbsp;
for. Her dream is not only connected to Luffy, it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:10.720
literally is traveling with the straw hats and&nbsp;
seeing the real world outside Wano for the very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:17.280
first time. You know how Luffy liberated every&nbsp;
single Straw hat that joined the crew from some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:23.600
sort of prison, either literal or mental.&nbsp;
Zoro from the nave base, Nami from Arlong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:29.760
Sanji from his sense of worthlessness, Brook from&nbsp;
his loneliness, Jinbe from a freaking impel down.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:36.560
And he liberates Yamato from both her physical&nbsp;
chains that had forced her to stay on Wano,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:41.920
but also from her fathers tyrannical&nbsp;
rule alongside with the people of Wano.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:47.840
What I'm probably most excited about is the&nbsp;
dynamic that Yamato will bring to the crew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:52.880
overall. Let me know if you feel the same&nbsp;
way, but to me, her character brings back a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:59.440
ton of pre-time skip energy. A true powerhouse&nbsp;
with the the same nativity and enthusiasm of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:04.880
early Luffy. Everything she sees will be&nbsp;
new and awesome to her. Seeing the sunny,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:10.000
riding on it on the ocean. Meeting new people,&nbsp;
fighting enemies outside of wano. I can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.440
absolutely see Yamato, in true Oden-fashion&nbsp;
running of with a grin attacking random pirate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:21.040
ships and just like luffy talking to and&nbsp;
exploring everyone and everything she sees.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:25.040
Just think about how great her&nbsp;
chemistry with the crew will be.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:29.280
Even though she is arguably one of the&nbsp;
most powerful characters in the story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:35.600
she will be eager to see Chopper create medicine,&nbsp;
be the ultimate audience for all of Usopps lies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:41.440
help Robin with the Poneglyphs through Oden's&nbsp;
diary, be a true sparring partner for Zoro,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:48.240
Sanji and Brook of course already love her anyways&nbsp;
and I don't see how she wouldn't get along with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:55.200
Nami. I like to think that Yamato will refresh&nbsp;
all of our experiences with the crew as well.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:01.200
Chemistry is the most important factor for me&nbsp;
personally when it comes to any new straw hat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:08.960
but of course power plays a role as well.&nbsp;
But do we even need to talk about that?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:17.600
Yamato was going head to head with Kaido, alone,&nbsp;
for quite a while while Luffy was out. I really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:22.960
don't want to rank her among the straw hats, maybe&nbsp;
Zoro is stronger, maybe she is, but I'm not sure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:30.480
anyone besides Luffy would have been able to do&nbsp;
that. With Yamato we basically get a mini-kaido&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:37.280
joining the crew. She has been trained by the&nbsp;
Yonko, knows all his moves, can use advanced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:41.600
conquerer's Haki and will be the third&nbsp;
Zoan fruit user to join the crew with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:47.840
her mythical inu inu no mi, that even gives&nbsp;
her ice powers. So a mini Aokiji on top.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:55.200
Not only does Yamato have room to grow and&nbsp;
develop as a person traveling with Luffy and co,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.200 --> 00:06:00.880
as I talked about earlier, but there&nbsp;
is still quite a lot unclear about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:07.600
who she really is? As far as we know, she&nbsp;
does in fact seem to be Kaido's actual child,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:14.800
but we don't know why Kaido had a kid to begin&nbsp;
with and who Yamato's mother is. No matter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:21.200
from what angle I look at it, I couldn't think of&nbsp;
anyone better to become part of the crew of a new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:28.640
emperor, that will be an invaluable asset in the&nbsp;
terrifying fights and trials that are yet to come.

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:33.680
I'm also really curious what bounty Yamato&nbsp;
will get once the new posters arrive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:39.600
It will definitely be more than me. My current&nbsp;
one is 59.000.000 100 berries for each of you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:45.040
who is subscribed. So our first priority&nbsp;
right now as a crew is to overtake at least&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:51.680
this terrible man here. Trebol, who&nbsp;
despite his constantly running nose has a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:57.840
99M berry bounty on his head. So please&nbsp;
help us overtake him by subscribing.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:02.320
Oh! Also, I absolutely love&nbsp;
Tama's reaction to Yamato&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:08.640
telling the crew she will sail with&nbsp;
them. It would be awesome to have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:13.920
her on board as well, after all she and&nbsp;
Yamato both hoped to join Ace one day.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:20.960
Tama's flashback during this chapter made the&nbsp;
entire thing even more emotional than it already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:28.320
was. We already got Toko's memories of Yasu&nbsp;
and their poverty growing up, and Tama's hits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:34.160
just as hard if not harder. We see her losing&nbsp;
her parents and trying to make a living selling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:39.920
the same hats, that she showed Ace how to make.&nbsp;
At least she had a puppy Komainu by her side,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:44.320
which makes the entire thing&nbsp;
somewhat more bearable to read&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:50.720
until finally Tenguyama steps in to take her&nbsp;
in. I'm still pretty convinced that he will turn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:57.280
out to be someone we have seen before somewhere.&nbsp;
One of the former Damyos or some other important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:02.080
person from the past. I'm really curious to&nbsp;
find out who he is, and whether that entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:08.320
Tengu thing with the mask and the wings is&nbsp;
a fashion choice or a Devil Fruit power.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:14.240
But as if ecstasy about Yamato and sadness and&nbsp;
relief for Tama weren't enough for my poor heart&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:20.880
in one chapter, Oda-sensei had to throw in awe&nbsp;
and shock as well. Because finally, finally,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:28.640
finally we get to see Momo's 28 year old self.&nbsp;
And oh boy, adult momo in the shogun's kimono&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:34.240
with the giant Kozuki crest, flowing long&nbsp;
black hair and a determined look on his face&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:41.760
is so so much more than what I ever expected.&nbsp;
He looks absolutely badass, there is no other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:49.680
way of saying it. Comparing this kid, no MAN&nbsp;
giving a fierce speech to his people to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:57.520
momo we first met on Punk Hazard. Momo had by&nbsp;
far the most underrated character arc throughout&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:04.000
all of Wano. His change has been absolutely&nbsp;
incredible and his reunion with his sister,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:09.200
who also has suffered through so&nbsp;
much is truly heart-warming to see.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:14.000
Honestly, after the last two chapters&nbsp;
did leave the end of the raid feel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:19.840
quite unresolved and open, seeing Momo like&nbsp;
this, seeing Tama and Toko being freed from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:26.240
their pain and everyone cheering, this felt like&nbsp;
a immensely satisfactory ending to the battle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:33.840
even if there might still be more fighting to be&nbsp;
done in wano and the arc seems far from over yet.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:39.920
But most importantly, we now have Yamato,&nbsp;
my personal best girl in one pice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:45.040
finally join the ranks of the crew, giving the&nbsp;
straw hats 3 powerful Zoan devil fruit users.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:52.000
And if you want to know whether Luffy, Yamato and&nbsp;
chopper are amongst the best 5 zoan devil fruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.360
you really shouldn't skip this video right here.

